WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.034
Russian President

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:01.768
Vladimir Putin

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:02.902
made a rare

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.070
in-person appearance

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.072
at a meeting of his Security Council

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:06.940
for the first time

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.109
since he invaded Ukraine in February.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:09.943
Well, aside,

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.277
from a brief clip of the meeting

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.946
that aired on state television

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:13.546
showing Mr.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.515
Putin with key members of his inner

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.016
circle,

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.417
the rest of the discussion

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.652
took place behind closed doors

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.121
Well, this comes as Ukraine has

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.856
seen has been rather

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.025
under a barrage of missile

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:25.992
strikes, many of them

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.595
targeting its energy infrastructure

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.766
CNN contributor and former

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.200
CNN Moscow bureau

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.201
chief Jill Dougherty

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.037
joins me now from Washington, D.C.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.172
She's also an adjunct professor

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.607
at Georgetown University.

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.875
So good to see you, Jill.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.777
A number of Ukrainian cities,

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.078
including the capital Kiev,

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.746
have come under attack from Russian

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:47.647
missiles, again,

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.116
hitting critical energy infrastructure.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:51.484
Ukrainian President

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:52.719
Zelensky is now warning

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.687
that up to 10 million

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.290
people are in the dark with no power.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.359
Now, the prime minister is warning

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.326
that the capital could face

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.195
a complete shutdown of its power grid,

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:03.396
just as temperatures

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.265
are expected to drop

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.534
to -10 degrees Celsius.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:08.902
What's your read on Mr.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:09.702
Putin's plan

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:10.470
hitting now

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.871
critical civilian infrastructure

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.074
in this phase of the war?

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:14.374
You know,

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:17.444
this is obviously part of his plan.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:20.847
Both to decimate the possibility

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:24.217
that Ukraine Ukraine can really respond

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:25.385
very strongly.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:25.919
After all,

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:28.488
this is affecting any type of power

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.223
and that affects civilians

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.658
as well as the military,

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.526
but especially civilians.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.028
And then I think also

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:35.728
what he's doing

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.465
is sending a message to the West

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.800
that the price that you're going to pay

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.634
for supporting

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.471
Ukraine is going to be very, very high.

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:48.441
So it's really a dastardly

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.544
approach to, you know,

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.113
attacking civilians.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.214
But that is the war

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.549
that he is waging right now.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.618
So is very difficult

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.720
because even though they try

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.055
and I saw some reports

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.857
that they have been very quickly

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:06.059
trying to restore power in many cases

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:08.094
is going to be a very brutal

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.530
and difficult winter for Ukrainians

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:13.533
in a striking development.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.467
Russian state

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.202
television aired images of Russian

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.170
President Vladimir Putin

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.405
at a meeting of his Security Council,

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.440
the first

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.641
since a long time

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:24.444
since February when this all began,

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:25.912
especially coming

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:28.114
after the setback in Harrison.

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:29.482
What message

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.285
do you think this is meant to send?

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.855
Well, you know, when he was

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:38.291
when he was last week

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.093
personally at a meeting

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.661
with the Security Council,

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.596
it was precisely, as you said,

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.265
at the beginning of the war.

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.666
And then after that,

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:47.834
he would participate.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.370
They did participate virtually.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:50.937
And, of course,

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.505
there was a lot of concern

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.673
and a lot of protection

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.376
for President Putin in terms of cold.

00:02:56.543 --> 00:02:58.711
They've been very, very worried

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.914
about exposing him to anything.

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.515
Remember those pictures of him

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.250
at the very long table?

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.386
Well, I think physically being there

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:07.754
is probably a sign

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:10.023
to show that he's on the case.

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:13.259
He is, you know, talking with the

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.061
with his Security Council

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.496
that he has controlling things.

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:18.031
I think it's a symbol of what

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:19.732
they're trying to get across

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.568
is some type of stability

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:22.502
and strength on

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:23.570
the part of the president.

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:26.372
I know it's very difficult to gauge,

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:26.873
but do

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.775
we have any way of knowing

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:30.643
whether there is dissent

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.845
within his inner circle,

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.847
especially seeing what has happened

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:37.317
in this past week?

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:40.086
Yeah, that is always hard to gauge.

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:41.988
I mean, we do know that there

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:44.257
there is some second thought.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.959
There are some second thoughts

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:47.160
about this

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.829
among some members of the elite.

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:51.998
But when you get into Putin's

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:53.199
inner circle,

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.468
it's very hard to say precisely

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:57.537
what is going on.

00:03:57.537 --> 00:04:00.506
And that that is one of the problems is

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.140
his inner

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.276
circle is very small, or at least

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:05.278
we are led to believe that

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:06.379
that the people really

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:07.280
he is surrounded

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.615
by are people

00:04:08.615 --> 00:04:12.085
from security forces, from the military.

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:17.423
And, you know, police police, FSB, etc..

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:21.661
So to a lot of those people, obviously,

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:22.161
you know,

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:24.764
are many times on the side of Putin

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:25.231
in terms

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:25.965
of really

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:28.001
taking the war to the Ukrainians

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:31.104
and sometimes even harsher than Mr.

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:32.572
Putin himself.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:35.675
But it's very hard to gauge that.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.644
We do know, however,

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:38.811
that we have some people

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.113
in the business community

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:41.414
who have spoken out.

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:42.081
And certainly

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:43.249
there is some

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:45.918
protest diminishing in protest

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:48.054
among the people themselves.

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:49.622
And in conclusion, Jill,

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:50.523
what does

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:52.225
the state of play on the battlefield

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:54.294
do for the influence of oligarchs

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:55.995
like Yevgeny

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:58.097
Ghosn, whose Wagner group

00:04:58.197 --> 00:04:59.198
mercenary is now

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:00.466
literally on the front lines?

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:01.801
Well, I

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.436
mean, with Prigozhin

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:05.705
and the Wagner group,

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:08.474
I think it gives him, you know, business.

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:12.345
His people are being hired to fight.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:13.146
But also,

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:14.947
it gives him some political clout.

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.182
He already had it.

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:17.483
But now in the war, he's

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.484
very important

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:21.387
element of the way that the Russians are

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.656
are fighting this war.

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:26.192
So I think his influence

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:28.127
certainly has increased.

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.662
That would be one thing.

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:32.432
And but, you know, whether or not

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:33.366
that really is

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:36.035
what's driving things, perhaps it is.

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:36.769
But I think

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:38.671
a lot of this is simply driven

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:40.740
by Putin himself,

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.376
who shows no sign of going back.

00:05:43.409 --> 00:05:43.643
You know,

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:46.012
there's a debate in the United States

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:46.979
right now

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:48.381
in the Biden administration

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:50.049
as to whether or not,

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:50.350
you know,

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.352
they would urge Ukraine

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:54.554
to come to the negotiating table.

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:56.756
And I think, you know, the division

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:58.925
there is that some people feel

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.393
the Ukrainians actually

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:02.261
have been doing very well.

00:06:02.261 --> 00:06:04.697
And maybe now's the time to lock in

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:06.933
some of those gains that there are others

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:07.934
who look,

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:08.401
as we've

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:11.270
just been discussing at this prospect,

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:12.905
the very long war,

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:13.706
and say,

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:14.507
well, you know,

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:16.609
the Ukrainians ought to just continue.

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:19.245
But we cannot tell them what to do.

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:20.747
That's the mantra

00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:22.515
from this administration.

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.817
And the phrase, you know, again, is

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:27.553
nothing about Ukraine without Ukraine.

00:06:27.987 --> 00:06:29.789
And they continue to say

00:06:29.789 --> 00:06:30.590
they really need it.

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.426
Jill Dougherty, thank you so much.

